le@vdwaa.nl&gt; - 353.1-1" date="1765800000">- Release workflow fixes</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Martin Pitt &lt;mpitt@redhat.com&gt; - 354-1" date="1767787200">- Convert documentation to AsciiDoc\n- Work around Firefox 146/147 bug (rhbz#2422331)\n- Bug fixes</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Fedora Release Engineering &lt;releng@fedoraproject.org&gt; - 354-2" date="1768564800">- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_44_Mass_Rebuild</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Fedora Release Engineering &lt;releng@fedoraproject.org&gt; - 354-3" date="1768564801">- Rebuilt for https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Fedora_44_Mass_Rebuild</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 355-1" date="1769688000">- ws: Remove obsolete pam_cockpit_cert module\n- shell: add StartTransientUnit as a sudo alternative</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 356-1" date="1770811200">- systemd: Allow editing timers created by Cockpit\n- Convert license headers to SPDX format</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 357-1" date="1772193600">- lib: Use browser context menu on shift\n- bridge: support Python 3.14 on old kernels (RHEL 8)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 358-1" date="1773835200">- Networking: Add Wi-Fi support\n- Cockpit Client updated to GTK 4\n- Bugfixes and translation updates</changelog>\n</package>\n')
